MMOODDUULLEE TTYYPPEESS PPRROOVVIIDDEEDD
       Only the ppaasssswwoorrdd module type is provided.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEESS
       PAM_AUTHTOK_ERR
           No new password was entered, the user aborted password change or
           new password couldn't be set.

